This program is a Solana port of the Blindfill vault (contracts/vault), itself a NEAR port of Privacy Pools v1 core
(github.com/0xbow-io/privacy-pools-core, tag v1.3.0), Copyright 2025 0XBOW LTD, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Its deposit and withdrawal logic, constants, scope, label and context follow Privacy Pools' contracts
(State.sol, PrivacyPool.sol, Entrypoint.sol) as the vault ports them; each ported file names its source. Privacy Pools
ships no NOTICE file at that tag. The changes from the vault are listed in src/lib.rs.

src/verifier.rs makes the Groth16 check in the shape of groth16-solana 0.2.0's `verify` (github.com/Lightprotocol/
groth16-solana, src/groth16.rs; Light Protocol), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; no code is copied.
The program calls Solana's sol_poseidon (light-poseidon's circom parameters) and alt_bn128 functions through the
solana-poseidon and solana-bn254 crates, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

src/tree.rs ports zk-kit's LeanIMT insert (@zk-kit/lean-imt.sol 2.0.0, InternalLeanIMT.sol `_insert`; Privacy &
Scaling Explorations, Ethereum Foundation), whose licence follows:

